// xfail: E270
// test_e270_static_extrn.bpp — `static extrn` is meaningless: an extrn is a
// REFERENCE to a definition elsewhere, and visibility belongs to the
// DEFINING module. The prefix parsed silently for months (301 declarations
// wore it); the 2026-07-07 storage cleanup swept them to plain `extrn` and
// made the spelling a diagnostic.
static extrn some_slot;

main() {
    return 0;
}
